# 埋点深层上报链路

Source: [KM 2754645174](https://km.example.com/collabpage/2754645174)

## 链路总览

```
// 代码块
this.food.mv(bid, valLab)
=> Food.mv(bid, { ...valLab, queryid })
=> Statistic.mv(...)
=> lxTrackModuleView(...)
```

## 具体分析

food 类型是 @meishi/biz-base-max 的 Food 类（附在最下面）

其中上报方法是 mv

```
// 代码块
  mv(bid: string, valLab?: object): void {
    const lab = { ...valLab, ...this.commonParm };
    return this.statistic.mv(bid, lab);
  }
```

先将外部收集到的参数和 commonParm（它会自动补一个queryid） 拼接，接着调用 类静态方法mv

```
// 代码块
  mv(bid: string, valLab?: object): void {
    lxTrackModuleView({
      channelName: this.channelName,
      val_cid: this.cid,
      pageInfoKey: this.pageInfoKey,
      val_bid: bid,
      val_lab: this.wrapObj(valLab),
    });
  }
```

他拼接上环境信息后调用 lxTrackModuleView 真实的曝光上报

```
// 代码块
export const lxTrackModuleView = normalize(args => {
  const {
    channelName,
    pageInfoKey,
    val_bid,
    val_cid,
    val_lab,
    success,
    fail,
    complete
  } = args;
  try {
    LX.moduleView({
      category: channelName,
      bid: val_bid,
      cid: val_cid,
      valLab: val_lab,
      pageInfoKey
    });
    success && success();
    complete && complete();
  } catch (e) {
    fail && fail(e);
    complete && complete(e);
  }
}, CONTAINER_NAME.MRN, 'lxTrackModuleView');
```

只是通过 normalize 统一 Promise回调风格、调用耗时和成功率统计 包了一层在 LX.moduleView外面

LX.moduleView 在 mrn-sdk/src/index.ts (line 413) 做了几件事：

- 校验 bid
- 保证 valLab 是对象
- 自动补 category
- 给 valLab 加一个 mrnInfo，见 mrn-sdk/src/index.ts (line 442)
- 用 setTimeout 延后发送，避免 mv 早于 pv，见 mrn-sdk/src/index.ts (line 447)

真正发出去时，会优先走 MSI bridge，否则退回到原生桥 NativeModules.Statistics.moduleView，见 mrn-sdk/src/index.ts (line 47)。

那么 埋点SDK 就通过桥接层交给了埋点系统，由系统 后端日志 清洗、落库、入数仓表

## Food 类

```
// 代码块
export class Food implements IFood {
  readonly props: IConfig;

  private _router: Router | undefined;
  private _network: Network | undefined;
  private _report: Report | undefined;
  private _statistic: Statistic | undefined;
  private _lifeCycle: LifeCycle | undefined;

  constructor(props: IConfig) {
    this.props = props;
  }

  private get report() {
    if (!this._report) {
      this._report = new Report({
        appKey: this.props.appKey,
        webCatKey: this.props.webCatKey,
        extraParams: this.props.pageParams,
      });
    }
    return this._report;
  }

  setCanReport(canReport: boolean) {
    this.report.setCanReport(canReport);
  }

  error(e: Error | string, label?: string, tags?: object): Promise<void> {
    return this.report.error(e, label, tags);
  }

  warn(e: Error | string, label?: string, tags?: object): Promise<void> {
    return this.report.warn(e, label, tags);
  }

  async metric(
    key: string,
    label: string,
    opt?: {
      value?: number;
      tags?: Record<string, string>;
    },
    ignoreLog?: boolean,
  ): Promise<void> {
    return this.report.metric(key, label, opt, ignoreLog);
  }

  private get network(): Network {
    if (!this._network) {
      // 这里传入pageParams, 在web侧用作通参设置
      this._network = new Network({ report: this, pageParams: this.props.pageParams });
    }
    return this._network;
  }

  request<T>(config: IRequestConfig): Promise<T | null> {
    return this.network.request<T>(config);
  }

  private get router(): Router {
    if (!this._router) {
      this._router = new Router({ report: this });
    }
    return this._router;
  }

  back(): void {
    return this.router.back();
  }

  route(url: string, metricKey: string, options?: Record<string, string>): void {
    return this.router.route(url, metricKey, options);
  }

  get statistic(): Statistic {
    if (!this._statistic) {
      this._statistic = new Statistic({
        channelName: CHANNEL_NAME,
        cid: this.props.cid,
        rootTag: this.props.rootTag,
        report: this,
      });
    }
    return this._statistic;
  }

  get pageInfoKey(): string {
    return this.statistic.pageInfoKey;
  }

  get commonParm(): object {
    const queryParam = this.props.pageParams as { queryId: string };
    return { queryid: queryParam?.queryId ?? '' };
  }

  pv(valLab?: object): void {
    return this.statistic.pv(valLab);
  }

  pd(valLab?: object): void {
    return this.statistic.pd(valLab);
  }

  mv(bid: string, valLab?: object): void {
    const lab = { ...valLab, ...this.commonParm };
    return this.statistic.mv(bid, lab);
  }

  mc(bid: string, valLab?: object, tag?: string, customTag?: { key: string; tag: object }): void {
    const lab = { ...valLab, ...this.commonParm };
    return this.statistic.mc(bid, lab, tag, customTag);
  }

  autoPVD(): IAutoPVD {
    return this.statistic.autoPVD();
  }

  private get lifeCycle(): LifeCycle {
    if (!this._lifeCycle) {
      this._lifeCycle = new LifeCycle({ rootTag: this.props.rootTag });
    }
    return this._lifeCycle;
  }

  bindLifeCycleListener(listener: ILifeCycleListener) {
    this.lifeCycle.bindLifeCycleListener(listener);
  }

  deleteLifeCycleListener(listener: ILifeCycleListener) {
    this.lifeCycle.deleteLifeCycleListener(listener);
  }

  release(): void {
    // 兜底处理autoPVD，防止内存泄漏
    this.autoPVD().stop();
    // 同兜底处理，防止内存泄漏
    this._lifeCycle?.release();
  }
}
```